t("Stone Vines", "Piedra Vines", "talent name")
t(" and %0.1f Arcane", "%0.1f Arcane", "tformat")
t("Eldritch Vines", "Arcano Vines", "talent name")
t("Rockwalk", "Caminarrocas", "talent name")
t("Rockswallow", "Tragarrocas", "talent name")

t("Each time one of your stone vines deals damage to a creature it will restore %0.1f equilibrium and %0.1f mana.\n\t\tYour vines also become infused with eldritch energies, dealing an additional %0.1f arcane damage.", "Cada vez que una de sus vides de piedra trata daño a una criatura que restaurará el equilibrio de %0.1f y %0.1f mana.\nTus vides también se infunden con energías eldritch, tratando un daño adicional %0.1f arcane.", "tformat")
t("Merge with one of your stone vines, traversing it to emerge near an entangled creature (maximum range %d).\n\t\tMerging with the stone is beneficial for you, healing %0.2f life (increases with Willpower).\n\t\tThis will not break Body of Stone.", "Incorpórese con una de sus vides de piedra, atravesándola para emerger cerca de una criatura enredada (máximo rango %d).\nMerging with the stone is beneficial for you, healing %0.2f life (increases with Willpower).\nEsto no romperá el Cuerpo de Piedra.", "tformat")
t("Merge your target (within range %d) with one of your stone vines that has seized it, forcing it to traverse the vine and reappear near you.\n\t\tMerging with the stone is detrimental for the target, dealing %0.1f nature damage.\n\t\tThe damage will increases with your Willpower.", "Combina tu objetivo (dentro de la gama %d) con una de tus vides de piedra que lo ha incautado, forzándolo a atravesar la vid y reaparecer cerca de ti.\nMerging with the stone is detrimental for the target, dealing %0.1f nature damage.\nEl daño aumentará con tu fuerza de voluntad.", "tformat")
t("From the ground around you, you form living stone vines extending from your feet.\n\t\tEach turn, the vines will attempt to seize a random target within radius %d.\n\t\tAffected creatures are pinned to the ground and take %0.1f nature%s damage each turn for %d turns.\n\t\tA creature entangled by the vines will have a chance to break free each turn, and will automatically succeed if it is more than %d grids away from you.\n\t\tThe chance to affect targets and damage increase with talent level and Willpower.", "Desde el suelo que te rodea, formas vides vivas de piedra que se extienden desde tus pies.\nCada vuelta, las vides intentarán apoderarse de un objetivo aleatorio dentro de %d radio.\nLas criaturas afectadas están clavadas en el suelo y toman %0.1f la naturaleza%s daña cada vuelta para turnos de %d.\nUna criatura enredada por las vides tendrá la oportunidad de liberar cada vuelta, y tendrá éxito automáticamente si eres más que las cuadrículas de %d lejos de tú.\nLa oportunidad de afectar objetivos y daño aumentas con talento y fuerza de voluntad.", "tformat")
t("Each time one of your stone vines deals damage to a creature it will restore %0.1f equilibrium and %0.1f mana.\n\t\tYour vines also become infused with eldritch energies, dealing an additional %0.1f arcane damage.", "Cada vez que una de sus vides de piedra trata daño a una criatura que restaurará el equilibrio de %0.1f y %0.1f mana.\nTus vides también se infunden con energías eldritch, tratando un daño adicional %0.1f arcane.", "tformat")
t("Merge with one of your stone vines, traversing it to emerge near an entangled creature (maximum range %d).\n\t\tMerging with the stone is beneficial for you, healing %0.2f life (increases with Willpower).\n\t\tThis will not break Body of Stone.", "Incorpórese con una de sus vides de piedra, atravesándola para emerger cerca de una criatura enredada (máximo rango %d).\nMerging with the stone is beneficial for you, healing %0.2f life (increases with Willpower).\nEsto no romperá el Cuerpo de Piedra.", "tformat")
t("Merge your target (within range %d) with one of your stone vines that has seized it, forcing it to traverse the vine and reappear near you.\n\t\tMerging with the stone is detrimental for the target, dealing %0.1f nature damage.\n\t\tThe damage will increases with your Willpower.", "Combina tu objetivo (dentro de la gama %d) con una de tus vides de piedra que lo ha incautado, forzándolo a atravesar la vid y reaparecer cerca de ti.\nMerging with the stone is detrimental for the target, dealing %0.1f nature damage.\nEl daño aumentará con tu fuerza de voluntad.", "tformat")
